00:19:29.290 --> 00:19:30.790
It's no dream.

00:19:32.160 --> 00:19:37.580
You'll be able to walk normally
and live a normal life now.

00:19:37.580 --> 00:19:41.250
Um, could you pinch my cheek, please?

00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:44.450
Again with the classic lines...

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:50.950
Well, uh...

00:19:50.950 --> 00:19:53.540
Um, I'm happy for you.

00:19:56.910 --> 00:20:00.790
Demon Lord, can we walk around a little longer?

00:20:03.750 --> 00:20:07.290
Now you don't have to let me
ride on your back anymore.

00:20:07.290 --> 00:20:10.080
I can always give you a lift when you're tired.

00:20:11.950 --> 00:20:14.290
Promise you'll never leave me?

00:20:15.580 --> 00:20:21.750
You should save that line for the future
when you meet a guy you like.

00:20:21.750 --> 00:20:23.830
But I already...

00:20:23.830 --> 00:20:25.660
...decided on you.

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:29.200
We're back!

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:35.080
How was your leg, Aku? Did the pervert
Demon Lord do anything to you?

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:39.370
You can be so rude... In a way, I'm impressed.

00:20:42.200 --> 00:20:47.040
Yu, you did an excellent job.
I was right to have picked you.

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:51.120
What is this feeling?

00:20:51.870 --> 00:20:56.040
My body... My heart... My cells...

00:20:56.040 --> 00:21:00.830
I'm trembling with bliss all the way
to the tips of my hair...

00:21:00.830 --> 00:21:07.040
It's like an all-powerful creator has
finally acknowledged my presence...

00:21:07.040 --> 00:21:12.000
An overwhelming sense of
euphoria enveloping my body...

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:16.620
I'll be needing your support from
here on out. I'm counting on you.

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:18.370
R-Right!

00:21:20.290 --> 00:21:25.540
Why? Being praised like this...
Being needed like this...

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:28.620
Why does it make me so happy?

00:21:28.620 --> 00:21:31.660
I feel differently than how I've always felt.

00:21:31.660 --> 00:21:35.540
And the chief is different
than he used to be too!

00:21:35.540 --> 00:21:40.330
I want to know more!
About these feelings... and the chief!

00:21:42.410 --> 00:21:47.000
"Learned Survival Skill: 'Heroine!!'"

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:01.700
<i>I wish I could go back</i>

00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:04.410
<i>Is what someone said</i>

00:22:04.410 --> 00:22:09.200
<i>But I don't have a past</i>

00:22:09.200 --> 00:22:12.200
<i>For eternity</i>

00:22:12.200 --> 00:22:14.700
<i>That nothing would change</i>

00:22:14.700 --> 00:22:19.450
<i>Is what I thought</i>

00:22:19.450 --> 00:22:22.250
<i>Over and over </i>

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:25.580
<i>Rubbing my eyes to make sure</i>

00:22:25.580 --> 00:22:29.660
<i>I'm overwhelmed by emotion</i>

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:32.910
<i>Like a lie</i>
<i>Bright! Still locked up</i>

00:22:32.910 --> 00:22:35.790
<i>Hiding what I couldn't give up</i>

00:22:35.790 --> 00:22:39.950
<i>That miracle lit up by my heart</i>

00:22:39.950 --> 00:22:43.160
<i>Not sought out, not doubted</i>

00:22:43.160 --> 00:22:46.120
<i>But still you believed</i>

00:22:46.120 --> 00:22:50.540
<i>As if to teach me</i>

00:22:50.540 --> 00:22:56.370
<i>RE NEW ME</i>
<i>Now that I'm laughing with you</i>

00:22:56.370 --> 00:23:03.290
<i>I can embrace it all</i>

00:23:03.290 --> 00:23:09.040
<i>Once again</i>

00:23:17.910 --> 00:23:21.870
Today, I walked hand-in-hand with Aku.

00:23:21.870 --> 00:23:27.120
At the start of all this, I was upset
at being pulled into a world like this.

00:23:27.120 --> 00:23:30.540
But just by being able to mend Aku's leg,

00:23:30.540 --> 00:23:34.540
it might've been worth
coming to this world after all.

00:23:37.620 --> 00:23:39.580
Demon Lord...

00:23:41.580 --> 00:23:42.000
Next time: <i>Demon Lord, Retry</i>
Episode 5. Merciless Invasion.

00:23:42.000 --> 00:23:47.000
"Merciless Invasion"
Next time: <i>Demon Lord, Retry</i>
Episode 5. Merciless Invasion.
